y world. Players build poker hands \u2014 pairs, straights, flushes, and more \u2014 to deal damage to enemies across procedurally generated dungeon floors. Each run features card drafting, loot rewards, and a branching map with combat, shop, rest, and event nodes.\n\nChoose from five character classes (Warrior, Rogue, Wizard, Paladin, Warlock), each with a unique starter deck and playstyle. Collect and equip up to five passive power cards that trigger special effects during combat. Enhance your deck at the Forge between floors, and invest in persistent town upgrades that carry across runs.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/rogue-quest", "videos": [{"id": 184363, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "fsOTmKWaz4Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fsOTmKWaz4Y", "title": "Rogue Quest - Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fsOTmKWaz4Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 184364, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "es_WFWLXaI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=es_WFWLXaI8", "title": "Rogue Quest  - Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/es_WFWLXaI8/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}